  "goodToKnow": "Der Einbau is installation or fitting: der Einbau einer Heizung, der Einbau neuer Fenster. Die Einbauküche (EBK in flat ads) is a fitted kitchen, and it's a famous German peculiarity that many rental flats come without one, so tenants buy and install a kitchen and sometimes sell it to the next tenant. Einbauen means to install. Der Einbauschrank is a built-in cupboard. Plural: die Einbauten."
